This package ships a WebAssembly module, dist/auth/rego/wasm/keykeeper_rego_wasm_bg.wasm,
compiled from the Tasra network's keykeeper-rego crate (the Rego policy gate and evaluator
for OAuth authorization envelopes) together with the third-party Rust crates below. Their
notices follow. Exact versions are recorded in dist/auth/rego/wasm/PINS.json and in the
network repository's Cargo.lock at the commit PINS.json names.

